      "content": "That's a pretty strong stance. You're basically saying the retributive approach is \"flawed\" and just part of the \"status quo.\" If someone believes that justice requires a clear, punitive consequence to maintain social order and moral accountability, are you saying their entire moral framework is just wrong?",
